From: RG35XX Java Platform
Task: RGJ-RC1-011R / 007
Subject: [PATCH] PlatformGraphics: materialize clipped drawRGB fast path

This executable diff targets the exact pinned FreeJ2ME PlatformGraphics owner.
It preserves the existing argument validation and source scanlength arithmetic,
resolves translation/clipping before the pixel loops, forces opaque output when
processAlpha is false, and skips fully transparent pixels without allocation.

